{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36850","headline":"寄徐济进士 · 罗隐","name":"寄徐济进士","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"往年疎嬾共江湖，月满花香记得无。\n霜压楚莲秋後折，雨催蛮酒夜深酤。\n红尘偶别迷前事，丹桂相倾媿後徒。\n出得函关抽得手，从来不及阮元瑜。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36850.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36850","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}